            <div xml:id="d99">

                <pb facs="0359" n="45" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg45"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/147</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Belgium</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Whitlock</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-05T09:00:00+00:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 5, 1914, 9 a.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 3:30 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Seat of Government may be transferred to Antwerp within the fortifications. In
                    that case diplomatic corps may follow. Has Department any instructions for me on
                    this subject?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitlock</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
